          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On October 17, 2009, at 11:30 PM, a witness captured video of approximately ten flying objects at 30 meters above ground level. During the 15-minute observation, the objects moved in a coordinated and noise-less manner towards the south-southwest. No other reports of this phenomenon in the area were collected. This witness likely observed the passage of flying lanterns.",
